<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Moja Strona</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111, #222);
      color: #fff;
    }
    header {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #000;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .card {
      background: #1a1a1a;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #000;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    a {
      color: #4da6ff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Strona Rozpieszczonego Bachora</h1>
    <p>Czekajcie na nowe nuty na YT</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>O mnie</h2>
      <p>Tu wbijacie na mojego YT Rozpieszczony Bachor i na spotifaja.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Co robię?</h2>
      <p>• Gaming 🎮<br>• Muzyka 🎧<br>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Kontakt</h2>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:twojemail@email.com">f.kucharski12@wp.pl</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 Twoja Strona</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
